.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH sentinel-cache-prune 1  "prune " 
.SH NAME
sentinel\-cache\-prune \- Remove cache entries not used since the given age and report what was removed. Last use is approximated by the entry\*(Aqs modification time. A prune that removes nothing succeeds and reports zero
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsentinel\-cache\-prune\fR [\fB\-\-older\-than\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Remove cache entries not used since the given age and report what was removed. Last use is approximated by the entry\*(Aqs modification time. A prune that removes nothing succeeds and reports zero
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-older\-than\fR \fI<DAYS>\fR [default: 30]
Remove entries whose last use is older than this many days. Defaults to 30: recent advisory data survives while stale entries are reclaimed
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
